  "body": "https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/urls-and-fetching.html#terminology-2\r\n\r\nThis portion of the spec defines three urls (about:legacy-compat, about:html-kind, and about:srcdoc) as \"reserved, though unresolvable\".\r\n\r\nI have an intuitive understanding of what it means for a url to be \"unresolvable\", but I can't find a definition in the HTML spec or in any of the specs it references. Am I missing something? If not, should this term be defined somewhere?",
